Select Apple's public SDK typed-allocation backdeployment branch.

Source: libmalloc-812.100.31 (c49dafa25f1efe8607701ae6014a663ad2ee437f),
include/malloc/_malloc_type.h. Scope: macOS SDK 26.5, arm64 and x86_64.

Apple's tests/malloc_type_backdeploy.c selects __APPLE_BLEACH_SDK__ to
exercise public SDK fallback. The pinned public packaging script omits
this selection. This diff captures the previous recipe's exact output
from unifdef -x2 -D__APPLE_BLEACH_SDK__ on the pinned header.

Evidence: .agents/skills/review-macos-c-sdk/scripts/sdk_review/headers/data/macosx26.5/ranked-header-differences.md
records the macOS 13/14 weak and strong import and fallback checks.

